                        <English>
                            <Text>&lt;b&gt;His visits to the Nomad households opened Faruq Pasha's eyes,&lt;/b&gt; at least a little. He has resolved to do further penance by giving up his greatest indulgence: the marzipan sent to him by the finest confectioners of the capital. Help him resist temptation by keeping the Envoys' supply of marzipan low.</Text>
